{"indicator":"offshore","unit":"W/m²","years":[2025],"notes":{"TWN":"離岸 50 公里內的海面平均 800 W/m²，在 194 個臨海國家中排第 16（含風比較弱、水很深的東部外海）。台灣海峽在東北季風與海峽的狹管效應下風很強：彰化外海（北緯 23.75°–24.25°、東經 119.85°–120.4° 的海面）平均 1,355 W/m²，比北海南部（英國、荷蘭、德國離岸風場所在，北緯 53.5°–55.5°、東經 2°–6°）的 1,013 W/m² 還高。經濟部能源署 2015 年公告的 36 處離岸風電潛力場址多在彰化、雲林、苗栗外海；2026 年 6 月已裝設 500 座離岸風力機、累計 4.8 GW（能源署）。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Sea within 50 km of the coast averages 800 W/m², ranking 16 of 194 coastal countries (this includes the deep, less windy waters off the east coast). The Taiwan Strait is very windy as the north-east monsoon is funnelled through it: the sea off Changhua (23.75–24.25°N, 119.85–120.4°E) averages 1,355 W/m², more than the 1,013 W/m² of the southern North Sea, home to British, Dutch and German offshore wind farms (53.5–55.5°N, 2–6°E). Most of the 36 offshore wind zones announced by Taiwan's Energy Administration in 2015 lie off Changhua, Yunlin and Miaoli; 500 offshore turbines totalling 4.8 GW had been installed by June 2026 (Energy Administration)."},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[0,479]},"values":{"ABW":[0,673],"AGO":[0,123],"AIA":[0,316],"ALB":[0,412],"ARE":[0,166],"ARG":[0,972],"ASM":[0,259],"ATG":[0,313],"AUS":[0,479],"AZE":[0,503],"BEL":[0,778],"BEN":[0,157],"BES":[0,421],"BGD":[0,177],"BGR":[0,381],"BHR":[0,299],"BHS":[0,303],"BIH":[0,297],"BLM":[0,329],"BLZ":[0,209],"BMU":[0,518],"BRA":[0,296],"BRB":[0,335],"BRN":[0,71],"CAN":[0,656],"CHL":[0,1033],"CHN":[0,469],"CIV":[0,96],"CMR":[0,53],"COD":[0,61],"COG":[0,47],"COK":[0,334],"COL":[0,337],"COM":[0,149],"CPV":[0,392],"CRI":[0,140],"CUB":[0,301],"CUW":[0,533],"CYM":[0,290],"CYP":[0,241],"DEU":[0,798],"DJI":[0,272],"DMA":[0,371],"DNK":[0,839],"DOM":[0,348],"DZA":[0,447],"ECU":[0,143],"EGY":[0,389],"ERI":[0,319],"ESH":[0,819],"ESP":[0,525],"EST":[0,723],"FIN":[0,666],"FJI":[0,343],"FLK":[0,1301],"FRA":[0,637],"FRO":[0,1309],"FSM":[0,183],"GAB":[0,68],"GBR":[0,994],"GEO":[0,289],"GGY":[0,787],"GHA":[0,131],"GIN":[0,66],"GLP":[0,337],"GMB":[0,